UID:event-hayy-makers@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T131814Z
DTSTART:20260714T150000Z
DTEND:20260716T180000Z
SUMMARY:Hayy Makers | Woodworking Course (Level 2) with Ahmad Sofi
DESCRIPTION:An intermediate woodworking course focused on advancing technical skills through machine work\, carving\, joinery\, design planning\, and finishing techniques. Participants will gain the confidence to execute more complex projects with precision and craftsmanship. * Completion of the Foundations of Woodworking Course (Level 1) or equivalent prior woodworking experience is required. Learning Outcomes: Learn workshop safety protocols and proper use of personal protective equipment. Use Jigs and modify machine cuts.
LOCATION:Hayy Jameel - Hayy Makers\, First Floor
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-hayy-makers.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-hayy-cinema-3@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T131814Z
DTSTART:20260715T060000Z
DTEND:20260806T150000Z
SUMMARY:Hayy Cinema | In Short: Film Programme — Summer Edition
DESCRIPTION:In Short: Film Programme — Summer 2026 Edition This summer\, Hayy Cinema invites audiences to discover In Short \, a new programme dedicated to the art of short filmmaking. Running until August 6\, the programme brings together three distinct slots: Our Stories: Bold works by emerging Gulf filmmakers and distinctive regional voices Borderless Intersections: A cclaimed international short films Across Generations: F amily-friendly adventures for younger audiences and the young at heart.
LOCATION:Hayy Jameel
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-hayy-cinema-3.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-the-comeback@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T131814Z
DTSTART:20260724T210000Z
DTEND:20260725T205900Z
SUMMARY:The Comeback
DESCRIPTION:يعود بطل العالم السابق للوزن الثقيل، أنتوني جوشوا، إلى الحلبة في جدة، ليواجه كريستيان برينغا غير المهزوم، في نزال حاسم. The Comeback ضمن رياضة وفعاليات جماهيرية في جدة. تبدأ الفعالية ٢٥‏/٠٧‏/٢٠٢٦، ١٢:٠٠ ص وتنتهي ٢٥‏/٠٧‏/٢٠٢٦، ١١:٥٩ م حسب البيانات المتاحة. تعرض الصفحة وقت الفعالية وموقعها ومصدرها وروابط التقويم والاتجاهات عند توفرها. المصدر: Visit Saudi Summer Calendar PDF.
LOCATION:جدة
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-the-comeback.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-hayy-makers-2@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T131814Z
DTSTART:20260726T140000Z
DTEND:20260728T180000Z
SUMMARY:Hayy Makers | Introduction to Pottery Course with Pharah Al-Ghalib
DESCRIPTION:This intensive three-day course with artist and designer Pharah Al-Ghalib offers a comprehensive introduction to wheel-thrown pottery\, guiding participants through the full spectrum of the ceramic process. Day 1 Clay & Wheel Fundamentals: Focuses on understanding clay—its qualities\, preparation\, and potential. Participants will learn wedging techniques before moving to the wheel to practice centering\, opening\, and pulling walls\, creating several forms to be set aside to dry to a leather-hard stage.
LOCATION:Hayy Jameel - Hayy Makers\, First Floor
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-hayy-makers-2.html
END:VEVENT
